{
  "name": "dsh-graceful-restart",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "DSH（DeepSeek Harness）优雅重启/关闭/启动守护插件：启动方式不变（dsh web），自动套壳拉起正式实例；等轮次结束后优雅重启并唤醒智能体继续；启动失败自动回滚新增插件（多版本成功基线、官方 CLI）；页面自动刷新；设置菜单可调快照版本数。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/sandbox-test.mjs"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
